  lines:
  - leftSpeaker: 1
    speakerName: Link
    text: "Hey there, Link speaking, I\u2019m the pilot of the Berserker !\r\n\n\n"
  - leftSpeaker: 1
    speakerName: Link
    text: 'Our forces have developed a new tool to help you win: say Hello to the
      NitroGroove !

'
  - leftSpeaker: 1
    speakerName: Link
    text: 'To use it, you must simply go on the red tile. It will give you +5 ATK
      to your next attack.

'
  - leftSpeaker: 0
    speakerName: Otto
    text: "We won\u2019t hesitate to use it too !\r\n"
  - leftSpeaker: 0
    speakerName: Otto
    text: "Be quicker and smarter than them, recruit. \nI\u2019m sure you\u2019ll
      be just fine. Good luck !\r\n\r\n"
